ough the pharmacy channel; and independent distributors. Insulet Corporation was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Acton, Massachusetts.","description_en":"Insulet Corporation develops, manufactures, and sells insulin delivery systems for people with insulin-dependent diabetes in the United States and internationally. The company offers Omnipod platform products comprising Omnipod 5 automated insulin delivery system, which includes a proprietary AID algorithm embedded in the pod that integrates with a third-party continuous glucose monitor to obtain glucose values through wireless Bluetooth communication; Omnipod DASH insulin management system that features a Bluetooth enabled pod that is controlled by a smartphone-like personal diabetes manager with a color touch screen user interface; and the Omnipod Insulin Management System. It also provides pods for Amgen for use in the Neulasta Onpro kit, which is a delivery system to help reduce the risk of infection after intense chemotherapy. The company sells its products to end-users through the pharmacy channel; and independent distributors. Insulet Corporation was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Acton, Massachusetts.","description_zh":"Insulet Corp.（美股代碼：PODD）為 Healthcare 領域之重要企業，專注於 Medical - Devices 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"100 Nagog Park","city":"Acton","state":"MA","zip":"01720","country":"US","phone":"978 600 7000","full_address":"100 Nagog Park, Acton, MA 01720, US","range_52w":"126.4-354.88","year_high":354.88,"year_low":126.4,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":126.4,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"Pease Flavia","title":"officer: EVP & CFO","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":1882,"price":130.79,"total_val":0.25},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"MAZELSKY JONATHAN JAY","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":141,"price":130.47,"total_val":0.02},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"H